{"id": "EUVD-2026-96998", "enisaUuid": "e8ef60a4-434c-3732-8f36-7e152a0187db", "description": "hyper-mcp through 0.8.3 contains a signature verification bypass vulnerability in load_wasm in src/wasm/oci.rs that verifies the Cosign signature of a separately resolved tag rather than the loaded manifest. Attackers controlling registry responses for the tag can serve an unsigned malicious manifest to the loader and a signed one to Cosign, executing unsigned WebAssembly plugins with configured host capabilities.", "datePublished": "2026-10-11T13:25:58", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-13T16:59:55", "baseScore": 8.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:P/PR:N/UI:N/VC:L/VI:H/VA:N/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://hackmd.io/@1ExmmukzRMWN7B4gQ4W-4Q/hyper-mcp-oci-signature-manifest-toctou", "https://github.com/hyper-mcp-rs/hyper-mcp/blob/v0.8.3/src/wasm/oci.rs#L79-L148", "https://github.com/hyper-mcp-rs/hyper-mcp/blob/v0.8.3/src/wasm/oci.rs#L193-L224", "https://github.com/hyper-mcp-rs/hyper-mcp", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/hyper-mcp-through-0.8.3-oci-plugin-signature-verification-toctou-race-condition"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-108698", "GHSA-phv4-c98f-77h3"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.24, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "198f86b4-b65f-3c5c-8e3f-146fe9941c29", "product": {"name": "hyper-mcp", "vendor": {"name": "hyper-mcp-rs"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22640.8.3"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "d9a105c8-6d5c-3f4f-92bf-077eface6015", "vendor": {"name": "hyper-mcp-rs"}}], "isExploited": false}